      "body": "Hi @navzen2000 ,\r\n\r\nBy default, Kubescape [does NOT submit the results](https://github.com/armosec/kubescape/blob/54020d317ed81697c7160698bd8a881909f4242f/core/core/initutils.go#L122).\r\nIf you scan once with the submit flag, kubescape will submit the results. If you wish not to submit results you can delete the cache (file and configMap -> `kubescape config delete`) or scan with the `keep-local` flag\r\n\r\nSince this is open source you can confirm this behavior.\r\n",
